{"4480310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SpaceSteps", "steam_appid": 4480310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue missions in near-Earth space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpaceSteps combines classic platforming, action, space realism and cutting-edge technology in a rescue story. The game offers breathtaking views of real sky in an orbit around the Earth, in zero gravity and on high detailed space station or even on the surface of the moon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/extras/b98b63067974e62aeca56bb0f9230e0b.avif?t=1782646574\" width=1004 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only hope remains - YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you control and navigate a small spherical maintenance robot ORBISS moving around the structures, inside and outside the space station. With the help of ORBISS, you collect vital supplies for the crew from the parts of the space station that has fallen into pieces. The robot is constantly threatened by concerns about the survival of the crew, the depletion of its own energy, as well as meteors and space station debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/extras/03a3b4adedca2792ccb393a6002575f8.avif?t=1782646574\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/extras_big/03a3b4adedca2792ccb393a6002575f8.avif?t=1782646574 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORBISS - the smallest hero in space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ORBISS (Orbital Repair Buddy – Integrated Survival System) is a small spherical work module that uses sensors, magnets and propulsion system to move around the station's structures and surfaces, performing inspections, repairs and logistics independently. It can carry small loads and is also capable of demolition and defense tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the event of a disaster, ORBISS's special tasks are activated: Keep astronauts alive and survive on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was not designed to be a hero, but t<i>he disaster is about to begin...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Pilot, play SpaceSteps in Early Access now! Leave feedback in the Steam discussions and together we will make the game according to your wishes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rescue missions in near-Earth space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SpaceSteps combines classic platforming, action, space realism and cutting-edge technology in a rescue story. The game offers breathtaking views of real sky in an orbit around the Earth, in zero gravity and on high detailed space station or even on the surface of the moon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/extras/b98b63067974e62aeca56bb0f9230e0b.avif?t=1782646574\" width=1004 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Only hope remains - YOU</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you control and navigate a small spherical maintenance robot ORBISS moving around the structures, inside and outside the space station. With the help of ORBISS, you collect vital supplies for the crew from the parts of the space station that has fallen into pieces. The robot is constantly threatened by concerns about the survival of the crew, the depletion of its own energy, as well as meteors and space station debris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/extras/03a3b4adedca2792ccb393a6002575f8.avif?t=1782646574\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/extras_big/03a3b4adedca2792ccb393a6002575f8.avif?t=1782646574 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ORBISS - the smallest hero in space</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ORBISS (Orbital Repair Buddy – Integrated Survival System) is a small spherical work module that uses sensors, magnets and propulsion system to move around the station's structures and surfaces, performing inspections, repairs and logistics independently. It can carry small loads and is also capable of demolition and defense tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the event of a disaster, ORBISS's special tasks are activated: Keep astronauts alive and survive on its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was not designed to be a hero, but t<i>he disaster is about to begin...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You Pilot, play SpaceSteps in Early Access now! Leave feedback in the Steam discussions and together we will make the game according to your wishes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Keep the International Space Station alive after a catastrophic meteor impact. The crew is dying and ORBISS, a small maintenance robot, is their last hope. Race to gather supplies, navigate the station and rescue the crew.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/d76e2360b5ebf3b91894a4bcdec2e34f7b78029a/header.jpg?t=1782646574", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/f96fe13bd2bb1fae02689b8ab92d3597efca6ef2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782646574", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4480310/f96fe13bd2bb1fae02689b8ab92d3597efca6ef2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782646574", "website": null, "pc_requirement